WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:20:00.000
Project JoyTwin on Guard Bounty Contract and Settlement (1st Attempt, Zero-Shot): with a novice sword (~0.6-1.5 HP/hit), a 1-on-1 duel against the 320 HP Ogre is objectively unwinnable—even after landing 71 hits (44.9 HP, ~14% of the Ogre's health), JoyTwin is overwhelmed and killed.
